It looks like you have successfully set up the connection! To answer your question: **The app will now automatically "adjust" to match your Google Sheet data.**

However, there is one small limitation in the current code: it only shows tools that are hardcoded in your `TOOL_CATALOG`. If you add a new tool directly to the Google Sheet (e.g., "New Fancy Wrench"), it might not appear in the dropdowns or summaries yet.

I will update the **Frontend** (`App.tsx` and `ToolModal.tsx`) to be **dynamic**. It will scan your Google Sheet history to find any tool names you've used, even if they aren't in the hardcoded list.

Here are the changes:

1.  **`App.tsx`**: Logic updated to combine the hardcoded catalog with any new tool names found in the transaction history.
2.  **`components/ToolModal.tsx`**: Updated the dropdown to show this combined list of tools.

